pkg:Evidence_v1_23_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.23.0 (STORY-10 grounded with real dependency map)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: read every one of the 11 pipeline agents' real call sites to build a genuine dependency graph, not guessed -- Tier 0 (Intent, root), Tier 1 (Story Author, Product Owner, Code Gen, Test Gen, all depending on Intent only, genuinely parallelizable with each other), Tier 2 (Grooming and Lineage Compose, both needing Story Author; Execution, needing Code Gen and Test Gen), Tier 3 (Conformance needing Lineage Compose; Sprint Planner needing Grooming and Lineage Compose), Tier 4 (DevOps needing Execution/Code Gen/Test Gen). Four of eleven stages can genuinely run concurrently right after Intent. Updated the Story's wantsCapability to reflect the coordinator-pattern design explicitly asked for: one coordinator per dependency tier, matching the real graph, not one monolithic coordinator. Deliberately did not implement the coordinator this pass -- the function is tightly coupled to progressive UI rendering and the real pipeline cannot be behaviourally exercised in this environment (requires a live LLM connection unavailable here); shipping an unverifiable rewrite of live async orchestration was judged worse than leaving it correct and sequential. Re-verified: pipeline order unaffected, full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "c9e50d4d140377fa3721b5f6e8f4769193ac0242f5624d0da0dc0627149a85e5"^^xsd:string .
